---
layout: layouts/home.njk
title: 小猪佩奇配置指南
description: cat 代理部署、局域网共享与多平台客户端共存配置指南。
bodyClass: home-page
---
{% from "components/icon.njk" import icon with context %}
{% set peppapig = guides | guideById('peppapig-deploy') %}
{% set clash = guides | guideById('clash-deploy') %}
{% set lan = guides | guideById('lan-sharing') %}

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <canvas class="hero__canvas" data-ambient-canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <p class="eyebrow">PeppaPig Configuration Guide</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">小猪佩奇<br>配置指南</h1>
    <p class="hero__summary">从 cat 内代理部署，到局域网共享与多平台客户端共存。</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ peppapig.url | url }}">配置 cat 代理 {{ icon('arrow-right') }}</a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="{{ '/guides/cross-platform/' | url }}">cat 与本地 VPN 共存</a>
      <button class="button button--glass" type="button" data-search-open>{{ icon('search') }} 搜索指南</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="path-section section-wrap" id="start">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">配置路径</p>
    <h2>从当前任务开始。</h2>
    <p>部署代理、分享给局域网，或解决已有客户端与 cat 的网络冲突。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="path-list">
    <a href="{{ peppapig.url | url }}" class="path-item">
      <span class="path-item__number">01</span>
      <span><strong>在 cat 内部署代理</strong><small>PeppaPig 与 Clash 两种方案</small></span>
      {{ icon('arrow-right') }}
    </a>
    <a href="{{ lan.url | url }}" class="path-item">
      <span class="path-item__number">02</span>
      <span><strong>共享代理到局域网</strong><small>端口分享、转发与连通验证</small></span>
      {{ icon('arrow-right') }}
    </a>
    <a href="{{ '/guides/cross-platform/' | url }}" class="path-item">
      <span class="path-item__number">03</span>
      <span><strong>配置客户端共存</strong><small>跨平台、iOS、Android 与 macOS</small></span>
      {{ icon('arrow-right') }}
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="recommendation-section">
  <div class="recommendation-section__inner section-wrap">
    <div class="recommendation-section__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">推荐起点</p>
      <h2>先让 cat 代理稳定运行。</h2>
      <p>完成安装、订阅导入与代理模式设置后，再按需要开启局域网共享或配置客户端共存。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="deployment-list">
      <a class="deployment-link" href="{{ peppapig.url | url }}">
        <span class="deployment-link__index">01</span>
        <span><strong>{{ peppapig.title }}</strong><small>{{ peppapig.summary }}</small></span>
        {{ icon('arrow-right') }}
      </a>
      <a class="deployment-link" href="{{ clash.url | url }}">
        <span class="deployment-link__index">02</span>
        <span><strong>{{ clash.title }}</strong><small>{{ clash.summary }}</small></span>
        {{ icon('arrow-right') }}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="client-section section-wrap" id="clients">
  <div class="section-heading section-heading--row">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">客户端共存</p>
      <h2>按你正在使用的软件查找。</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/guides/' | url }}">查看全部 {{ icon('arrow-right') }}</a>
  </div>

  <div class="client-list">
    {% for item in guides %}
      {% if item.home %}
        <a href="{{ item.url | url }}" class="client-row">
          <span class="client-row__platform">{{ item.platform }}</span>
          <span><strong>{{ item.shortTitle }}</strong><small>{{ item.summary }}</small></span>
          {{ icon('chevron-right') }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final-section section-wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">完整索引</p>
  <h2>所有配置文件与参考视频都已归档。</h2>
  <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ '/guides/' | url }}">打开指南库 {{ icon('arrow-right') }}</a>
</section>
